{
  "id": "section-640",
  "title": "对中共中央组织部的批评",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-020.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>020)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　中共中央组织部从来不向中央作报告，以至中央同志对组织部同志的活动一无所知，全部封锁，成了一个独立王国。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-019.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-021.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
